  "description": "Latch 2 is your versatile mid-sized folding e-bike built for riders who want comfort, capability, and convenience in one smart package. Its folding frame makes storage and transport easy while maintaining a stable, confidence-inspiring ride that feels comfortable and capable for everyday adventures. The mid-sized design, upright riding position, and smooth electric assist make neighborhood cruising, RV travel, beach rides, and everyday errands feel fun and effortless. The electric assist helps flatten hills and headwinds so you can ride farther with less effort.\n\nPedego e-bikes use safe and reliable battery packs certified to UL 2271, and the complete system meets UL 2849 standards, the gold standard for electrical and fire safety, because you and your family deserve peace of mind on every ride. While many e-bike brands skip this step, Pedego puts safety first so your only job is to enjoy the ride.",
